From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Aguilar <291639929+alexdev3372@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:52:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] skyrim: offer an opt-in experimental 60 fps mode

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Mac opt-in and an explicitly enabled local iOS diagnostic retain stock 30 fps by default and clear state on shell Quit.
Issue: seedds/nxnative#148
---
